  "description": "Tamp CommandPlan wrapper for Anchore's `syft` 1.x — universal SBOM producer. Scans directories, container images (registry / docker / podman / OCI archive / OCI dir), and single archives; emits CycloneDX (JSON / XML), SPDX (JSON / tag-value), syft-native JSON, GitHub JSON, or purls. Complements Tamp.CycloneDx.V6 (which only handles .NET via dotnet-CycloneDX). Pinned to V1 — syft 1.0 restructured the CLI around `syft scan <source>` and deprecated the bare `syft <source>` form.",
